; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Blinking Face
; CATEGORY: Animation & Many Turtles
; LEVEL:    Beginner
; TAGS:     animation, cartoon, ARC, DOT, random, WAIT
; SUMMARY:  A friendly cartoon face that looks around and blinks at random moments.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   Draws a round yellow face with rosy cheeks and a smile. The eyes
;   glance left, right and straight ahead, and every few seconds
;   the face blinks: the eyes are painted over with skin color and
;   replaced by closed eyelids, then they open again.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run and watch the face. Press Stop when you are done.
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * redrawing only the part that changes (the eyes)
;   * painting over something to hide it
;   * ARC for a smile and for closed eyelids
;   * RANDOM to decide when to blink and where to look
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Make the face wink with only one eye.
;   * Change the smile to a surprised round mouth.
;   * Make the blinks happen more often.
; ============================================================

; FACE draws the parts that never change.
to face
  setpencolor [255 210 80] setpensize 400 dot [0 0]
  setpencolor [250 150 140] setpensize 50
  dot [-120 -40] dot [120 -40]
  ; The smile: an arc of a circle centered below the eyes.
  penup setxy 0 -20 setheading 120 pendown
  setpencolor [120 50 40] setpensize 8
  arc 120 100
end

; EYE draws one open eye at (x, y), with the pupil shifted by :look
; (negative looks left, positive looks right).
to eye :x :y :look
  setpencolor 7 setpensize 70 dot list :x :y
  setpencolor [40 40 60] setpensize 30 dot list :x + :look :y
  setpencolor 7 setpensize 8 dot list :x + :look - 6 :y + 6
end

; CLOSED draws one closed eye: skin color over the open eye, then a
; curved eyelid line.
to closed :x :y
  setpencolor [255 210 80] setpensize 74 dot list :x :y
  penup setxy :x :y - 10 setheading 300 pendown
  setpencolor [120 50 40] setpensize 6
  arc 120 30
end

to open.eyes :look
  eye -80 60 :look
  eye 80 60 :look
end

to blink
  closed -80 60
  closed 80 60
  wait 8
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setbackground [180 220 250]
face
forever [
  open.eyes pick [-15 0 0 15]
  wait (random 60 180)
  blink
]
